      "first_message": "运行章节观察。本章：{{chapter_number}}。直接输出纯 JSON，引擎自动保存。\n\n==== 章节正文 ====\n{{chapter_file}}\n\n==== 世界状态 ====\n{{world_state_file}}\n\n==== 世界事件 ====\n{{world_events_file}}\n\n==== 单章指导 ====\n{{guide_file}}\n\n==== 伏笔列表 ====\n{{hooks_file}}\n\n==== 叙事债务 ====\n{{debts_file}}\n\n==== 长线角色状态 ====\n{{character_state_long_file}}\n\n==== 次要角色库 ====\n{{character_minor_file}}\n\n==== 世界观基础 ====\n{{world_foundation_file}}\n\n输出语言：{{language}}。",
      "position": {
        "x": 230,
        "y": 270
      },
      "var_bindings": {},
      "node_params": {},
      "auto_flow": false,
      "enable_complete_node_task": true,
      "output_variable": "",
      "enable_reject_upstream": false,
      "max_reject_count": 3,
      "save_output_to_file": true,
      "output_file_path": "cache/observer/obs_output.json",
      "sub_workflow_params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_arb",
      "label": "后验裁决器",
      "node_type": "agent",
      "agent_type": "novel-arbiter",
      "system_prompt_template": "",
      "first_message": "运行后验裁决。本章：{{chapter_number}}。直接输出纯 JSON，引擎自动保存。\n\n==== Observer 差异报告 ====\n{{obs_output_file}}\n\n==== 现有伏笔 ====\n{{hooks_file}}\n\n==== 现有叙事债务 ====\n{{debts_file}}\n\n==== 世界观基础 ====\n{{world_foundation_file}}\n\n输出语言：{{language}}。",
      "position": {
        "x": 450,
        "y": 130
      },
      "var_bindings": {},
      "node_params": {},
      "auto_flow": false,
      "enable_complete_node_task": true,
